Crow has no fixed-size integers: every expression is exact, and none overflows.

For 32-bit signed integers:
  expression                                                     Crow      32-bit signed keeps
  -(-2147483647 - 1)                                       2147483648              -2147483648
  2000000000 + 2000000000                                  4000000000               -294967296
  -2147483647 - 2147483647                                -4294967294                        2
  46341 * 46341                                            2147488281              -2147479015
  (-2147483647 - 1) / -1                                   2147483648              -2147483648

For 64-bit signed integers:
  expression                                                     Crow      64-bit signed keeps
  -(-9223372036854775807 - 1)                     9223372036854775808     -9223372036854775808
  5000000000000000000 + 5000000000000000000      10000000000000000000     -8446744073709551616
  -9223372036854775807 - 9223372036854775807    -18446744073709551614                        2
  3037000500 * 3037000500                         9223372037000250000     -9223372036709301616
  -9223372036854775808 / -1                       9223372036854775808     -9223372036854775808

For 32-bit unsigned integers:
  expression                                                     Crow    32-bit unsigned keeps
  -4294967295                                             -4294967295                        1
  3000000000 + 3000000000                                  6000000000               1705032704
  2147483647 - 4294967295                                 -2147483648               2147483648
  65537 * 65537                                            4295098369                   131073

For 64-bit unsigned integers:
  expression                                                     Crow    64-bit unsigned keeps
  -18446744073709551615                         -18446744073709551615                        1
  10000000000000000000 + 10000000000000000000    20000000000000000000      1553255926290448384
  9223372036854775807 - 18446744073709551615     -9223372036854775808      9223372036854775808
  4294967296 * 4294967296                        18446744073709551616                        0
